WEBVTT

00:04.690 --> 00:06.330
Why aren't we moving?

00:04.980 --> 00:08.480
U.A. • Shiketsu Route

00:06.330 --> 00:08.080
Get us moving!

00:12.090 --> 00:14.080
Mom, Sis--

00:14.080 --> 00:15.450
Don't get separated.

00:16.030 --> 00:18.480
I heard Mt. Lady and the others lost!

00:18.480 --> 00:21.250
No way! It's fake news!

00:21.250 --> 00:23.290
What happened?

00:23.290 --> 00:26.620
We believed and left it to them,
but for it to end up like this...

00:23.290 --> 00:27.290
Gentle's Swashbuckling Channel of Derring-Do

02:08.380 --> 02:10.070
We're still uncertain about
the full damage we received.

02:10.070 --> 02:12.800
All For One is heading east!

02:12.800 --> 02:15.190
Aiba! What's the situation?

02:15.190 --> 02:18.080
I've already taken control of
U.A.'s evacuation system.

02:18.320 --> 02:20.630
You see how some of the
blocks are already moving?

02:21.010 --> 02:21.930
But...

02:22.370 --> 02:25.110
There's a block that's being
stopped from the inside.

02:25.450 --> 02:27.370
Someone's made it stop.

02:29.650 --> 02:33.410
All For One told us to follow Skeptic.

02:33.410 --> 02:36.670
But we've lost contact! What should we do?

02:36.670 --> 02:39.440
We need to show All For One results.

02:39.990 --> 02:43.560
Once the day ends, the world
will be All For One's!

02:43.560 --> 02:46.690
If we don't give him results,
our lives will be...

02:47.340 --> 02:48.980
Found him!

02:54.110 --> 02:55.030
Tetsutetsu!

02:55.030 --> 02:56.130
Right!

03:03.680 --> 03:08.240
Even though I know what happens next...

03:08.840 --> 03:15.700
Even though I know that the same
thing will happen again...

03:16.840 --> 03:18.940
What the heck?!

03:20.060 --> 03:22.920
He'll die in vain! Is he suicidal?!

03:23.490 --> 03:25.150
My body's...

03:25.650 --> 03:28.430
...moving on its own, too.

03:29.370 --> 03:32.310
Blocks 17 to 32 have restarted!

03:32.310 --> 03:35.060
All For One has passed the
skies above Ido City!

03:35.060 --> 03:36.900
Who can still fight?

03:37.180 --> 03:39.630
We've put out a call to various groups,

03:39.630 --> 03:41.300
but everyone's wounded.

03:42.780 --> 03:44.030
What now?!

03:44.460 --> 03:45.790
This is bad...

03:46.130 --> 03:48.420
The heat... in Gunga...

03:48.420 --> 03:49.740
Dabi's heat...

03:49.740 --> 03:51.110
What about it?

03:51.110 --> 03:52.360
Report!

03:52.360 --> 03:53.760
Was Endeavor defeated?!

03:54.020 --> 03:55.790
No, not yet...

03:55.790 --> 04:00.420
But... our analysis is
concluding that he will be!

04:01.280 --> 04:06.040
Ever since Dabi was captured,
he's been storing up heat.

04:06.520 --> 04:10.230
He's been compressing it and storing it up!

04:10.900 --> 04:15.120
At this rate, in about ten
minutes... or even less...

04:16.040 --> 04:18.310
He'll annihilate himself...

04:19.150 --> 04:22.530
And the energy freed from that pressure

04:22.870 --> 04:26.740
will cause a high-pressure explosion
that will burn up everything

04:26.740 --> 04:29.230
within about 5 kilometers!

04:32.530 --> 04:35.990
Right now, within 5 kilometers
of Dabi's location

04:36.300 --> 04:40.580
lies the evacuation path that connects U.A.
in the east and Shiketsu in the west.

04:41.150 --> 04:43.460
Does Dabi know this...?

04:43.460 --> 04:46.270
No, there's no way...

04:46.820 --> 04:53.270
But if he received information about the
evacuation route from Skeptic back then...

04:54.150 --> 04:56.450
Contact them! Immediately!

04:56.450 --> 04:58.420
There are still blocks that can be stopped

04:58.420 --> 05:00.770
before they enter the predicted damage zone!

05:02.470 --> 05:04.120
Open the emergency hatch!

05:04.400 --> 05:06.100
Get to the surface!

05:06.380 --> 05:09.420
Tsukauchi, sir! All For One is accelerating!

05:10.030 --> 05:13.440
He's about to reach the estimated
effective range of the sludge warp!

05:17.890 --> 05:20.850
If the two Demon Lords
are in the same place,

05:21.670 --> 05:24.130
then there's nothing we can do...

05:25.400 --> 05:26.430
What about backup?

05:26.430 --> 05:27.960
There's no one.

05:27.960 --> 05:32.320
Even if there are still uninjured heroes
around, none of them will make it in time.

05:36.420 --> 05:37.430
Tsukauchi.

05:40.190 --> 05:44.190
Kamino Ward, Kanagawa

05:41.170 --> 05:43.920
Todoroki, you haven't recovered
from Phosphor yet—

05:44.510 --> 05:46.870
I said, I'm fine.

05:47.480 --> 05:51.020
All For One's going to get to Midoriya.

05:51.780 --> 05:53.640
I can still move!

05:54.260 --> 05:56.780
You have enough on your mind just
worrying about your brother!

05:57.740 --> 06:01.020
I have to do... what I can...

06:01.930 --> 06:06.150
It must have been so hard for
you to face him like that....

06:06.150 --> 06:07.820
It must have been heartbreaking...

06:08.250 --> 06:09.560
Wait!

06:09.560 --> 06:11.650
I can still move!

06:11.650 --> 06:13.460
Weren't you going to kill me?

06:13.460 --> 06:16.510
You're the half-baked one now!

06:17.300 --> 06:21.540
You're the one who kindly told me
to look at who I wanted to be.

06:22.250 --> 06:25.560
Why do you have to suffer like this?

06:26.750 --> 06:29.410
Oh, it connected!

06:30.310 --> 06:33.080
Are you two still okay?

06:33.080 --> 06:34.360
All Might?!

06:34.700 --> 06:37.560
There's no time, so I'll keep it short.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.620
You two need to run to Gunga right now.

06:41.380 --> 06:46.160
Dabi's about to explode, and an evacuation
block is in the blast zone.

06:46.600 --> 06:49.540
Right now, Endeavor's
keeping an eye on Dabi,

06:49.540 --> 06:53.080
but he can't stop the
explosion with his Quirk.

06:53.860 --> 06:57.210
Young Iida, I know you can run.

06:59.110 --> 07:03.350
Young Todoroki, the body and
mind are part of one unit.

07:03.700 --> 07:07.020
You should understand this after
everything you've been through.

07:07.020 --> 07:10.060
All Might, but All For One is--

07:10.060 --> 07:13.870
It's okay, we still have
someone strong in the wings!

07:15.180 --> 07:17.340
If you fight still carrying your doubts,

07:17.340 --> 07:18.750
then you can't win against that.

07:19.140 --> 07:26.140
After all your worrying and doubts, what
you decide in your heart is priceless.

07:27.290 --> 07:30.760
Stop Toya and give everyone
some peace of mind.

07:31.250 --> 07:33.200
So that you can be you.

07:33.550 --> 07:38.020
Right now, the only things that can do
something about the crisis at Gunga

07:38.020 --> 07:39.870
are Engine and Half-Cold Half-Hot.

07:39.870 --> 07:41.410
You two are our only hope!

07:41.410 --> 07:42.540
We're counting on you.

07:46.350 --> 07:53.120
Run? But your engines are stalled,
and Gunga is so far away...

07:55.200 --> 07:57.870
The rain's cooled down my legs nicely.

07:58.370 --> 08:00.660
I can run. I can!

08:02.440 --> 08:09.830
Todoroki, my legs are here
to guide lost children.

08:14.750 --> 08:16.720
For the sake of others...

08:18.510 --> 08:20.520
Hang on tight!

08:34.220 --> 08:36.190
Full speed ahead!

08:37.360 --> 08:41.710
We're leaving it to you, Young
Iida and Young Todoroki.

08:42.910 --> 08:45.260
Next, it's my turn.

08:48.320 --> 08:48.960
Tsukauchi—

08:48.960 --> 08:49.800
You idiot!

08:49.800 --> 08:51.810
What were you thinking?!

08:52.480 --> 08:55.090
This is fine, Tsukauchi.

08:56.050 --> 08:59.530
This was my fight in the first place.

09:02.350 --> 09:04.320
It brings back memories...

09:05.290 --> 09:07.140
of our long battle...

09:08.170 --> 09:14.030
I heard Shigaraki's hatred
has affected you?

09:15.240 --> 09:19.490
Then, you can't ignore me, can you?

09:19.490 --> 09:21.250
How are you planning on fighting?

09:21.250 --> 09:23.310
You're Quirkless, remember?!

09:24.160 --> 09:27.780
Even if I don’t have a
Quirk, can I become a hero?

09:28.130 --> 09:31.350
That's right. You can't ignore me.

09:32.130 --> 09:33.540
Why?

09:35.080 --> 09:38.780
Because I am here!

09:43.600 --> 09:45.980
Shoto Todoroki

09:46.230 --> 09:49.860
2 km from the Gunga Villa site

09:46.550 --> 09:47.850
Don't push!

09:47.850 --> 09:49.850
Please walk!

09:49.850 --> 09:51.870
I've restrained the suspects.

09:52.170 --> 09:55.370
But the evacuation block's
system board is dead.

09:55.370 --> 09:57.510
I'm going to give up trying to reboot it!

09:57.990 --> 10:00.490
Evacuation Block

09:58.420 --> 10:01.240
The U.A. robots will transport
you outside of the blast zone.

10:01.240 --> 10:03.200
Please don't look back!

10:05.340 --> 10:07.530
Don't look at Dabi!

10:08.940 --> 10:10.030
Toya...

10:16.550 --> 10:18.350
It's not just the evacuation block...

10:18.850 --> 10:23.090
Pixie-Bob and the others who are keeping
Toga and her clones in check right now are...

10:23.390 --> 10:27.360
Oh no, I'm starting to feel the damage from
my fight with All For One in my legs.

10:28.030 --> 10:32.120
I can't lead Toya much further...

10:38.280 --> 10:41.250
Daadd...

10:41.250 --> 10:43.490
Loookk...

10:44.660 --> 10:47.330
Dad, look!

10:47.330 --> 10:49.980
I can do this now!

11:01.950 --> 11:04.720
Stop your flames, Toya!

11:05.090 --> 11:07.800
Loookk...

11:08.730 --> 11:10.940
I don't want... to let you die...!

11:11.350 --> 11:15.440
Natsuu, let's plaayy!

11:15.440 --> 11:17.830
His consciousness...

11:19.550 --> 11:23.050
How was he able to keep going until now...

11:23.050 --> 11:26.020
with heat that's hot enough
to burn even me...?

11:29.680 --> 11:31.130
Toya...

11:31.680 --> 11:33.170
You are--

11:36.050 --> 11:37.880
The sense of danger you get
from facing certain death...

11:38.400 --> 11:42.330
Being close to death has been
known to awaken Quirks.

11:43.280 --> 11:48.300
On the other hand, humans have
a fight-or-flight response...

11:48.830 --> 11:51.220
That's different from awakening.

11:51.220 --> 11:54.580
It's power that manifests when
someone is on the verge of death.

12:06.330 --> 12:08.930
Rei's... Quirk...!

12:15.550 --> 12:18.470
I'll win and keep looking at Toya!

12:21.710 --> 12:22.820
It's all...

12:23.770 --> 12:26.060
...my responsibility.

12:29.520 --> 12:33.940
I thought I needed to bear it all
and live a life of atonement.

12:35.160 --> 12:39.210
But you were always watching
me, weren't you?

12:42.830 --> 12:45.240
I couldn't watch you the
way you wanted me to...

12:46.460 --> 12:49.250
I needed to make it up to you, too.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.750
I still have the same dream--

12:53.330 --> 12:55.840
The dream where my family
is together without me.

13:00.440 --> 13:02.750
I won't let you die alone.

13:05.100 --> 13:06.170
But...

13:07.520 --> 13:08.980
I won't...

13:09.930 --> 13:12.160
...get anyone else caught up in this either!

13:15.240 --> 13:17.640
I won't be able to get far
enough away on the ground.

13:18.010 --> 13:21.690
Toya, I'll borrow your firepower
to get into the sky!

13:23.670 --> 13:25.450
Wait! Please wait!

13:25.880 --> 13:27.520
Just a little longer...!

13:35.260 --> 13:36.090
Rei?!

13:37.210 --> 13:38.740
Why are you here?!

13:42.750 --> 13:43.770
Toya...

13:47.420 --> 13:48.350
Welcome.

13:48.350 --> 13:49.630
Mom?!

13:51.130 --> 13:54.440
Natsu, protect your sister.

13:55.560 --> 13:58.270
Take me to the middle of that, please!

13:59.400 --> 14:04.590
We were born to grant people's wishes.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.740
Toya!

14:15.830 --> 14:18.530
Are you trying to cool him down, Rei?

14:18.950 --> 14:22.260
Trying to cool him yourself,
you came this close...

14:22.930 --> 14:24.550
No! Get away!

14:24.860 --> 14:26.870
You'll just burn to death!

14:27.450 --> 14:30.600
The same goes for you and Toya, right?

14:31.930 --> 14:34.140
Momm....

14:34.500 --> 14:35.700
Toya...

14:36.540 --> 14:37.900
I'm sorry!

14:39.930 --> 14:44.560
Natsu... Fuyumi...

14:48.560 --> 14:49.730
You can't!

14:49.730 --> 14:53.200
No! I don't want anyone to go away anymore!

14:53.200 --> 14:55.990
Toya! Don't take everyone with you!

14:55.990 --> 15:00.000
Don't cause anyone anymore
trouble, stupid brother!

15:02.000 --> 15:06.410
If I increase the heat by my
movements, then Toya's body will...

15:07.820 --> 15:10.240
Please, I'm begging you--

15:11.230 --> 15:13.310
Let everyone else go!

15:21.030 --> 15:23.850
Everyone's... watching...

15:26.920 --> 15:28.790
Is that all it was?

15:29.390 --> 15:32.330
Something as simple as this?

15:33.620 --> 15:36.670
I wish I'd realized sooner...

15:50.330 --> 15:52.810
The temperature increase in
the center is slowing down!

15:53.150 --> 15:55.190
Calculations updating now!

15:55.190 --> 15:56.560
Then, at this rate...

15:56.870 --> 15:58.760
No, it's not decreasing!

15:58.760 --> 16:00.690
We can't avoid an explosion!

16:01.230 --> 16:02.770
Retreat!

16:02.770 --> 16:04.060
You'll get caught up in the blast!

16:04.060 --> 16:04.970
Get back!

16:07.270 --> 16:09.660
Kendo! Run!

16:09.920 --> 16:12.160
Don't worry! It's all right!

16:12.480 --> 16:13.360
Yeah.

16:27.330 --> 16:29.340
Don't worry.

16:30.300 --> 16:31.600
Because...

16:33.490 --> 16:35.380
...we've got Five Wees on our side.

16:37.000 --> 16:38.780
I can't believe it...

16:38.780 --> 16:39.970
Transonic speed...

16:40.300 --> 16:42.590
That's as fast as a fighter aircraft!

16:43.130 --> 16:46.110
Using constant ice production
to reduce resistance

16:46.460 --> 16:49.610
and then making a layer of air with
the heat to reduce friction.

16:49.930 --> 16:53.810
Right now, the only things that can do
something about the crisis at Gunga

16:53.810 --> 16:55.900
are Engine and Half-Cold Half-Hot.

16:55.900 --> 16:57.350
You two are our only hope!

16:57.780 --> 16:59.110
All Might...

17:00.320 --> 17:02.980
You were really teaching them...

17:12.210 --> 17:14.850
I can only take you this far!

17:15.230 --> 17:16.820
Thanks, Iida.

17:17.490 --> 17:19.130
Flashfire Fist...

17:19.130 --> 17:20.030
Phosphor!

17:32.310 --> 17:33.790
Todoroki!

17:33.790 --> 17:38.150
Thanks to you, I'm becoming
who I wanted to be!

17:38.800 --> 17:42.680
So you should be who you want to be, too!

17:47.180 --> 17:49.710
"Dear Mom,

17:52.040 --> 17:55.500
I try to speak in class every day
and talk to the other students

17:55.500 --> 17:59.510
so that I can be on equal footing
with the rest of the class.

18:00.760 --> 18:04.390
Since we talk about many things,
there are times when we clash.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.650
But after butting heads,

18:06.650 --> 18:09.290
there are times when we end up
understanding each other better.

18:10.400 --> 18:16.760
My friends get mad and cry not just for
themselves, but for the sake of others.

18:17.790 --> 18:20.330
I want to be like that, too.

18:21.370 --> 18:24.460
It's hard, but I'll do my best."

18:40.860 --> 18:43.210
When you surpass various limits...

18:43.210 --> 18:47.650
things end up getting inverted...

18:51.330 --> 18:53.410
My origin...

18:54.430 --> 18:57.480
If only it were so simple...

18:59.600 --> 19:02.830
If I'd been able to face them earlier...

19:03.800 --> 19:10.000
There are still things I want
to argue about and say!

19:11.240 --> 19:14.120
Great Glacial Aegir!

19:48.340 --> 19:51.150
You were... all here...?

19:54.150 --> 19:55.710
I see...

19:55.710 --> 19:59.390
It's not good, but I'm glad...

20:00.030 --> 20:05.720
I might not have been able to stop
him with just Great Glacial Aegir...

20:06.210 --> 20:10.310
Because Toya raised his
firepower way higher

20:10.940 --> 20:13.210
than what he had during our first fight...

20:13.950 --> 20:15.370
Shoto...

20:16.880 --> 20:19.300
E-Everyone...

20:20.420 --> 20:23.720
Die... scum dad...

20:23.720 --> 20:26.770
Die… all of you...

20:26.770 --> 20:29.880
Me too... die...

20:30.600 --> 20:32.640
He's freezing from the inside?

20:33.140 --> 20:34.300
Toya...

20:35.490 --> 20:37.820
Wait, what should we do?

20:38.220 --> 20:40.800
It's going to be hell after this...

20:42.510 --> 20:44.190
Toya...

20:44.190 --> 20:45.330
Sorry...

20:50.440 --> 20:56.790
Sorry I didn't go to Sekoto Peak...

21:05.190 --> 21:09.490
I hate you... Dad...

21:10.200 --> 21:12.710
The whole family...

21:13.520 --> 21:17.060
Yeah... Tell us...!

21:18.180 --> 21:19.310
More...!

21:22.430 --> 21:24.010
Rei...

21:24.010 --> 21:25.840
Sorry for driving you into a corner...

21:27.430 --> 21:28.490
Fuyumi...

21:29.120 --> 21:32.070
Sorry for pushing everything onto you...

21:32.960 --> 21:34.180
Natsuo...

21:34.950 --> 21:38.020
Sorry for neglecting you...

21:42.220 --> 21:43.490
Shoto...!

21:44.990 --> 21:46.680
I'm sorry...!

23:19.920 --> 23:21.920
Preview

23:21.490 --> 23:23.120
Here's the preview!

23:23.620 --> 23:28.520
The menace of Sad Man's Death Parade is
sweeping over the Gunga Villa site.

23:29.350 --> 23:32.770
In the midst of that, Uraraka
finds Toga's real body

23:33.090 --> 23:35.070
and tries to find out her true intentions.

23:36.030 --> 23:38.610
Inside the girl is sadness...

23:38.610 --> 23:39.630
Desire...

23:40.400 --> 23:42.410
And warped feelings...

23:43.500 --> 23:45.900
Next time, "A Girl's Ego."

23:45.900 --> 23:49.890
Next time: A Girl's Ego

23:46.300 --> 23:47.940
Go Beyond!

23:47.940 --> 23:49.570
Plus Ultra!
